    <a href="index.html" style="color:var(--teal); font-size:14px; text-decoration:none; display:inline-block; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">← Back to Submit</a>

    <div class="section-label">Overview</div>
    <p style="color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:2rem; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.8;">
      Systematic Reviews and Meta-Analyses should state a clear research question and use transparent methods for literature search, study selection, quality assessment, data extraction, and statistical synthesis.
    </p>

    <div class="section-label">Methodology</div>
    <div class="section-title" style="font-size:1.3rem;">Required Elements</div>
    <ul class="scope-list" style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
      <li>Databases searched, search period, and search terms</li>
      <li>Screening process, inclusion and exclusion criteria</li>
      <li>Data extraction method and risk of bias assessment tool</li>
      <li>PRISMA flow diagram of study selection process recommended</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="section-label">Meta-Analysis</div>
    <div class="section-title" style="font-size:1.3rem;">Statistical Reporting</div>
    <ul class="scope-list" style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
      <li>Type of effect size and model selection (fixed vs. random effects)</li>
      <li>Heterogeneity assessment (e.g., I², Q-test)</li>
      <li>Sensitivity analysis and publication bias assessment</li>
      <li>Rationale for subgroup analysis or meta-regression, where applicable</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="section-label">Limits</div>
    <div class="section-title" style="font-size:1.3rem;">Length & References</div>
    <ul class="scope-list" style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
      <li>Main text: up to 30,000 characters (excluding abstract and references)</li>
      <li>References: up to 50</li>
      <li>Tables and figures: up to 8 total</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="section-label">Materials and Methods</div>
    <div class="section-title" style="font-size:1.3rem;">Methodological Requirements</div>
    <ul class="scope-list" style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
      <li>Describe study population, design, sample source, inclusion/exclusion criteria, and measurement instruments in sufficient detail</li>
      <li>Human studies: state ethics committee name, approval number, and informed consent method</li>
      <li>Clinical trials: provide registry name and registration number</li>
      <li>Statistical analysis: state software, version, significance level, tests used, effect sizes, and confidence intervals</li>
    </ul>

    <div style="background:var(--navy); border-radius:8px; padding:2rem; text-align:center;">
      <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size:14px; margin-bottom:1rem;">Ready to submit your manuscript?</p>
